  "scope": "Read-only identity verification; no guest execution, build, proving, or deployment performed. Root will select source commit.",
  "original_s5_01": "S5-01 Release aday\u0131 ve ger\u00e7ek guest ELF P0 K\u0131smi Do\u011frulanan SP1 6.0.0 ailesi sabitlendi; bo\u015f olmayan ger\u00e7ek guest ELF ve vkey \u00fcretildi. Ayn\u0131 ortam/cache\u2019de zorlanan tekrar derlemede ELF hash\u2019i e\u015fit; komut, s\u00fcr\u00fcm ve hash kay\u0131tl\u0131. Kapan\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in gereken Kod ve kan\u0131t art\u0131k commit kimli\u011fine sahip; fakat \u00fcst ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131n kapanmas\u0131, nihai release aday\u0131n\u0131n se\u00e7ilmesi ve t\u00fcm kan\u0131t\u0131n o kaynak/toolchain ile tekrar e\u015flenmesi h\u00e2l\u00e2 gerekli. Release source SHA ve t\u00fcm ara\u00e7/ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131k s\u00fcr\u00fcmleri sabit. Sonraki somut ad\u0131m \u00dcst kap\u0131lar kapan\u0131nca birle\u015ftirilmi\u015f kaynaktan release aday\u0131 SHA se\u00e7. Lockfile ve Rust/Node/pnpm/Foundry/Solidity/SP1 s\u00fcr\u00fcmlerini sabitle; guest ELF/vkey manifest\u2019ini o SHA ile \u00fcret veya i\u00e7erik e\u015fle\u015fmesini do\u011frula. \u0130kinci build\u2019in kapsam\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131k\u00e7a kaydet. Ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131klar S3-03 (Tamamland\u0131) \u00b7 S4-05 (K\u0131smi) \u00b7 S4-08 (Tamamland\u0131) Kan\u0131t\u0131n s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 Commit\u2019in olu\u015fmas\u0131 g\u00f6revi kendili\u011finden tamamlamaz. E\u015fit ELF hash\u2019i ayn\u0131 makine/cache i\u00e7in \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcld\u00fc; ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z temiz container yeniden \u00fcretimi kan\u0131tlanmad\u0131. ELF/vkey, proof de\u011fildir. protocol/release-manifest.json protocol/guest-reproducibility-pinned-path.json checks/guest-build-family-locked.json",
